[00:19.22]There is a way of peace,
[00:22.30]The way you’ve come to know.
[00:25.26]It is the way you learned,
[00:28.32]The way of long ago,
[00:31.34]The way that Jesus taught you
[00:34.60]When his voice you heard.
[00:37.54]This is the way of peace,
[00:40.48]Found in Jehovah’s Word.
[00:43.39](Chorus)
[00:43.54]This is the way to life; This is the way.
[00:49.08]Don’t look aside; Not for a moment stray!
[00:55.59]God’s voice is calling: ‘This is the way;
[01:01.36]Do not look back, for yes, this is the way.’
[01:11.36]There is a way of love,
[01:20.80]No need to look around.
[01:25.86]God’s voice has shown the way
[01:29.12]He lets himself be found.
[01:32.10]His love is full and good;
[01:35.28]His love is warm and true.
[01:38.00]This is the way of love;
[01:41.62]It touches all we do.
[01:44.33](Chorus)
[01:44.48]This is the way to life; This is the way.
[01:49.96]Don’t look aside; Not for a moment stray!
[01:56.21]God’s voice is calling: ‘This is the way;
[02:02.46]Do not look back, for yes, this is the way.’
[02:20.90]There is a way of life,
[02:23.88]No need to look behind.
[02:26.86]Our God has promised us:
[02:29.94]No better way we’ll find,
[02:32.98]No higher way to peace,
[02:36.06]No finer way to love.
[02:38.74]This is the way to life,
[02:42.10]Thanks to our God above.
[02:45.14](Chorus)
[02:45.29]This is the way to life; This is the way.
[02:51.24]Don’t look aside; Not for a moment stray!
[02:57.02]God’s voice is calling: ‘This is the way;
[03:02.72]Do not look back, for yes, this is the way.’
